-- seed.sql
-- One-time seed data for initial game setup.
-- Run AFTER 002_full_schema.sql via Supabase SQL Editor or migration.
--
-- NOTE: player_id is NULL for all nations initially.
-- Create auth users and assign them via the admin UI or setup script.
--
-- Military seed is minimal here. Full military data (templates, formations,
-- units) is generated by the "Import Seed Data" admin Edge Function, which
-- replicates the TypeScript logic from the original server/src/index.ts.

